description=v3.6.1 the phone's own three-button navigation, switched by the phone's own overlay command (this app draws no bar of its own), with its Recents button handed to this mode's list - and put back to the owner's gesture navigation on exit. The ROM-background step no longer takes four minutes: the work is batched, the exit writes independent values together and stops the daemon before the revert instead of after it. RMX3430.
